{"ID":"20240513083318-3ngfb8x","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083318-3ngfb8x","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083318-3ngfb8x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513113704-sdotlsi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513113704-sdotlsi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513113704-sdotlsi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:599,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:599\u0026#125;","title":"092","type":"doc","updated":"20240515123525"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513113704-sdotlsi","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 916px;","id":"20240513113704-sdotlsi","updated":"20240515123525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪醫師病案紀錄   初診日期：2008/03/12"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"073-3 L, L"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"17歲，瘦小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080430"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. Angelman syndrome"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. Seizure(Angelman syndrome中有大於80%的小朋友會在3歲之前發作)，二、三年前開始服用西藥(Depakine, Klonopin)後，病人變得更昏睡、流口水，且仍有大發作。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 服前方後"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 服藥後(早晚各半碗)，隔天早上吐出許多透明、白黏稠痰"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 其母上網查後發現病人服用的二種西藥有一票副作用，且服用劑量已超過標準劑量數倍，所以自行減量1/2，所以病人持續出現肢體痉鑾、抖動現象，但痙攣及抖動在病人睡著時即停止，早上醒後20分鐘才會開始"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→因白天醒後引動”痰”故，矚其多喝濃蔗糖水，”肝苦急，急食甘以緩之”，且忌吃精製糖、奶製品，會產生更多痰，應多吃穀類、蔬菜。避免給予成塊食物，以免嗆到。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 胃口不佳"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 小建中湯4 + 小麥1(合炙甘草及大棗為甘麥大棗湯，如見神靈狀故用之)   200粉  早晚飯前二茶匙  每次加一匙麥芽糖"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 麥芽糖一罐"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 藜蘆一錢半(另包)  炙甘草二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→藜蘆甘草湯，去血脈神經中痰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→去胸中痰水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"百合五錢  熟地二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→百合地黃湯，舞蹈症用之"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝三錢  白芍六錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→小建中湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大棗十枚  小麥五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→甘麥大棗湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃二錢  細辛二錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四付  六碗煮二碗  早晚飯前各半碗  每服加麥芽糖一茶匙"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}